  "text": "This five-minute automated backup routine protects your digital income and customer records forever. Solo creators often delay backups because manually exporting data feels complicated and time-consuming after work. Losing access to your store database means rebuilding your entire buyer list completely from scratch. Configure a Make scenario that compiles weekly order summaries and deposits them into secure Dropbox folders. You will run your store with complete peace of mind.",
